---
/**
 * K Culture Wire — **차트에 오른 한국 배우들의 띠.** (`/zodiac`)
 *
 * ── 왜 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *   영어권이 사주에 대해 가장 자주 묻는 것이 「is this real」이다(4번이 6,743줄에서 잼).
 *   ⭐ 우리는 그 물음에 **우리 자로** 답할 수 있다 — 우리 명단의 배우 띠를 세면 된다.
 *
 * ── ⛔ 이 지면이 지키는 것 ────────────────────────────────────
 * ⛔ **한 사람을 판정하지 않는다.** 태어난 시각이 없다. 분포만 낸다.
 * ⛔ **어느 띠가 낫다고 안 쓴다.** 표를 **띠 차례대로** 낸다 — 크기 순이면 줄세우기가 된다.
 * ⛔ 「고르다」를 「사주가 가짜다」로 넓히지 않는다. 우리가 잰 것은 **배우가 되는 것**뿐이다.
 * ⛔ 광고 자리를 만들지 않는다. Riot Production(App 866800) 승인 전이다.
 * ⚠ 수를 손으로 적지 않는다. 전부 `wikitip-zodiac.json` 에서 읽는다.
 */
import WikiTip from '../../layouts/WikiTip.astro';
import KcwRelatedArticles from '../../components/KcwRelatedArticles.astro';
import d from '../../data/wikitip-zodiac.json';

const 가장많은 = [...d.counts].sort((a, b) => b.people - a.people)[0];
const 가장적은 = [...d.counts].sort((a, b) => a.people - b.people)[0];

const TITLE = 'The animal years of Korean actors who reached a Netflix chart';
const DESC =
  `${d.withZodiac} Korean actors with a usable birth year, counted by animal sign. Chance would put `
  + `${d.expectedPerSign} in each; the spread runs ${가장적은.people} to ${가장많은.people}. `
  + `Chi-square ${d.chiSquare} against a threshold of ${d.chiSquareThreshold}.`;

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Dataset',
  name: TITLE,
  description: DESC,
  creator: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'K Culture Wire' },
  isBasedOn: ['https://www.wikidata.org', 'https://www.netflix.com/tudum/top10'],
};
---

<WikiTip title={TITLE} description={DESC} jsonLd={jsonLd}
  canonical="https://www.kculturewire.com/zodiac">
  <h1>{TITLE}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{d.question}</p>
  <p class="q">
    <b>{d.withZodiac}</b> actors. Chance would put <b>{d.expectedPerSign}</b> in each sign.
    {' '}The count runs from <b>{가장적은.people}</b> to <b>{가장많은.people}</b>.
  </p>
  {/* 🔴 공유 카드가 62.3% 를 내걸었는데 이 지면에 그 수가 없어 `check-table-promises` 가 섰다.
      ⛔ 카드가 약속한 수는 **지면에 표로** 있어야 한다. 그 약속이 이 사이트의 값이다. */}
  <p class="note">
    Why it is worth counting at all: in a 2026 national survey of 1,200 people aged 13 to 69,
    {' '}<b>62.3%</b> of Koreans said they had had their fortune read at least once, and the country
    has <b>15,853</b> registered fortune-telling businesses.{' '}
    <a href="/article/two-in-three-koreans">The article explains what they are looking at</a>.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Every sign, in order</h2>
    <div class="scroll-x">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Animal year</th><th>Actors</th><th>Share</th>
          <th>Against {d.expectedPerSign} expected</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {d.counts.map((c) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="nm">{c.sign}</td>
              <td class="tot">{c.people}</td>
              <td>{c.sharePc}%</td>
              <td>{c.people - d.expectedPerSign > 0 ? '+' : ''}{(c.people - d.expectedPerSign).toFixed(1)}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="note"><b>{d.unit}</b> Listed in the order of the cycle, not by size.</p>
    <p class="q">
      Chi-square <b>{d.chiSquare}</b> against a 5% threshold of <b>{d.chiSquareThreshold}</b>.
      {' '}{d.indistinguishableFromChance
        ? 'The distribution is indistinguishable from chance.'
        : 'The distribution is further from flat than chance would give.'}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="warn-box">
    <h2>What this does not say</h2>
    <p class="warn">{d.cannotAnswer}</p>
    <p class="note">{d.whyNoIndividualReading}</p>
    <p class="note fine">{d.whyJanFebExcluded}</p>
  </section>

  {d.debutAge && (
    <section>
      <h2>When they started</h2>
      <div class="scroll-x">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Age at first credited work</th><th>Actors</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="nm">Lower quarter begins</td><td class="tot">{d.debutAge.lowerQuartile}</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="nm">Median</td><td class="tot">{d.debutAge.median}</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="nm">Upper quarter begins</td><td class="tot">{d.debutAge.upperQuartile}</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        Measured on {d.debutAge.people} actors whose first working year is recorded. Half of them
        started between {d.debutAge.lowerQuartile} and {d.debutAge.upperQuartile}.
      </p>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="src">
    <h2>How this was counted</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Source</b> — {d.source}</li>
      <li><b>Panel</b> — {d.peopleKeyed} actors carry an item number; {d.withBirthDate} have a
        usable birth date; {d.withZodiac} have a birth year we can turn into a sign.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="note">
      <a href="/actor-reach">How far an actor's titles travel</a> ·{' '}
      <a href="/actors">Who gets looked up</a> · <a href="/about">How we count</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <KcwRelatedArticles page="/zodiac" />
</WikiTip>

<style>
  .warn-box { border-left: 3px solid #b45309; padding-left: 1rem; }
</style>
